00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:08.867
Of their individual stake

00:06:08.867 --> 00:06:10.269
in the preservation

00:06:10.269 --> 00:06:12.204
of democratic life in America.

00:06:12.204 --> 00:06:13.972
Things that have

00:06:13.972 --> 00:06:15.707
toughened the fiber of our people,

00:06:15.707 --> 00:06:17.309
renewed their faith

00:06:17.309 --> 00:06:17.943
and strengthened

00:06:17.943 --> 00:06:19.378
the devotion to the institutions

00:06:19.378 --> 00:06:22.948
we make ready to protect and of quote.

00:06:23.815 --> 00:06:24.750
80 years ago,

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.185
after that speech, on this day

00:06:26.185 --> 00:06:28.887
two years ago, we were reminded

00:06:29.655 --> 00:06:32.357
