00:06:32.357 --> 00:06:35.127
democracy itself.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:35.827
As I've said

00:06:35.827 --> 00:06:37.429
before, we face an inflection

00:06:37.429 --> 00:06:39.798
point in our nation's history.

00:06:39.798 --> 00:06:42.334
On January 6th is a reminder

00:06:42.334 --> 00:06:43.068
that there's nothing

00:06:43.068 --> 00:06:45.771
