00:06:45.771 --> 00:06:46.438
Remember learning

00:06:46.438 --> 00:06:48.540
to undergraduate school, high school

00:06:49.207 --> 00:06:50.142
that every generation

00:06:50.142 --> 00:06:51.877
is required to earn it.

00:06:51.877 --> 00:06:53.512
Defend it. Protect it.

00:06:55.314 --> 00:06:57.115
I was a senator for a long time.

00:06:57.115 --> 00:06:59.117
I was vice president, then president.

00:06:59.284 --> 00:07:01.119
I have to tell you,

00:07:01.286 --> 00:07:02.254
I began to think,

00:07:02.254 --> 00:07:03.155
looking back on it,

00:07:03.155 --> 00:07:04.356
that it was just permanent

00:07:04.356 --> 00:07:05.991
in the United States.

00:07:05.991 --> 00:07:08.093
Just was eternal.

00:07:08.093 --> 00:07:10.062
Nothing would happen

00:07:11.029 --> 00:07:13.198
That's why I was so pleased

00:07:13.198 --> 00:07:14.733
to see Democrats and Republicans

00:07:14.733 --> 00:07:15.834
work together

00:07:15.834 --> 00:07:18.070
to pass the Electoral Count Reform Act

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.005
that I just signed into law

00:07:20.005 --> 00:07:21.907
to protect the will of the people.

00:07:21.907 --> 00:07:24.276
In the past, peaceful transfer of power

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:25.777
and defending

00:07:25.777 --> 00:07:27.112
and protecting our democracy

00:07:27.112 --> 00:07:27.746
also means

00:07:27.746 --> 00:07:29.948
that despite our differences of opinion,

00:07:30.882 --> 00:07:33.518
we must say clearly

00:07:33.518 --> 00:07:35.721
with the united voice

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:40.058
that there's no place 900 place

