00:07:52.404 --> 00:07:53.305
You know,

00:07:53.305 --> 00:07:55.674
America is a land of laws and not chaos.

00:07:56.441 --> 00:07:58.543
A nation of peace and not violence.

00:07:59.611 --> 00:08:00.846
We're not a land of kings

00:08:00.846 --> 00:08:03.014
and dictators, autocrats and extremists,

00:08:04.349 --> 00:08:06.485
