00:08:11.923 --> 00:08:13.792
renew our faith,

00:08:13.792 --> 00:08:15.794
and strengthen our cause.

00:08:15.794 --> 00:08:17.963
Just remember who in God's name we are

00:08:18.697 --> 00:08:21.299
who are the United States of America?

00:08:21.533 --> 00:08:25.136
Manager for the United States of America.

00:08:26.771 --> 00:08:28.673
And there's nothing

00:08:30.008 --> 00:08:31.376
there is nothing.

00:08:31.376 --> 00:08:33.044
There has never been a single thing.

00:08:33.044 --> 00:08:34.045
We've set our minds

00:08:34.045 --> 00:08:35.380
that we've been failed to accomplish.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:37.749
There's nothing beyond our capacity

00:08:37.983 --> 00:08:39.384
If we act together,

00:08:39.384 --> 00:08:41.386
remember who in God's name we are.

00:08:41.386 --> 00:08:42.721
So God bless you all.

00:08:42.721 --> 00:08:44.589
And may God protect our troops.

